tools.\n\n:::note\n*If you are reading this from a web page and not from the \
WLJS Notebook:*\n\nSome resources were kept within the notebook storage. \
Download the original notebook from the heading section to have all images \
and precalculated vertices.\n:::\n", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
